# Terminates TLS for the backend directly on the VM — no HTTPS Load Balancer
# needed at this scale (an LB's own forwarding-rule cost would eat into the
# savings this migration is for). Caddy auto-provisions and renews a Let's
# Encrypt certificate for the domain below the first time it starts, as long
# as DNS already points at this VM's external IP and ports 80/443 are open.
#
# Point both REST (/api) and the WebSocket (/ws) at the same place — it's one
# process either way. Update the domain to whatever you point at this VM
# (e.g. a new "ws.linkchat.in" A/AAAA record, or reuse the existing backend
# hostname once Cloud Run is no longer serving it).
ws.linkchat.in {
	reverse_proxy localhost:8080
}
